e stated workload scale. CloudFront serves 50% of requests from cache, reducing origin load and bandwidth costs; the 2,000 GB egress and 40 million requests per N4 are costed exactly. The architecture prioritizes meeting SLA requirements over minimizing absolute cost: the original at $545.06 fails to handle the workload, rendering it unsuitable regardless of price.",
